WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.548
Bada is beginning to learn phone manners.

2
00:00:10.549 --> 00:00:15.646
Let's see how he is doing.

3
00:00:15.647 --> 00:00:19.033
Mom: Bada, could you answer the phone?

4
00:00:19.034 --> 00:00:22.868
Bada: Sure. Hello?

5
00:00:22.869 --> 00:00:26.452
Mom: Say, "This is the Kangs' residence."

6
00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:29.183
Bada: This is the Kangs' residence.

7
00:00:29.184 --> 00:00:35.049
Who? Oh, she's not home yet. Bye.

8
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.935
Mom: Who was that?

9
00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:38.116
Bada: I don't know.

10
00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:41.500
A girl asked for Hana.

11
00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:45.106
Mom: Next time, say, "Who is calling please?"

12
00:00:45.107 --> 00:00:46.677
Bada: Okay, Mom.

13
00:00:46.678 --> 00:00:48.836
"This is the Kangs' residence.

14
00:00:48.837 --> 00:00:50.665
Bada: Who is calling please?"

15
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:52.316
How was that?

16
00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:55.246
Mom: Well done, Bada.

17
00:00:55.247 --> 00:00:57.989
Bada: Hada, repeat after me.

18
00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.139
"This is the Kangs' residence.

19
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.558
Who is calling?"

20
00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:07.621
Bada: Boy, you need to practice.

21
00:01:07.622 --> 00:01:11.735
Here you go.

22
00:01:11.736 --> 00:01:13.865
Bada: I am going to Tom's house.

23
00:01:13.866 --> 00:01:15.865
See you later, everyone.

24
00:01:15.866 --> 00:01:17.821
Mom: Be back by five.

25
00:01:17.822 --> 00:01:21.097
Bada: Yes, Mom.

26
00:01:21.098 --> 00:01:23.976
Bada did a good job on the phone.

27
00:01:23.977 --> 00:01:27.964
I guess he is growing up.
